  "todos": [
    "Obtain administrator evidence for compute-node container runtime/daemon access, Slurm GPU isolation, graphics/NVENC support, and the CloudXR port configuration.",
    "Verify the operator GUI path and Vision Pro stream endpoint during a real allocation; the application does not claim firewall reachability from configuration alone.",
    "The pinned record_demos.py command is stored as an operator step, not auto-executed. Confirm the site-specific container enter/attach command and manual Start AR sequence before promoting it to an automatic launcher step.",
    "Confirm that the requested nominal capture rate matches the selected task simulation dt; schema v3 stores step order but no per-sample timestamps.",
    "Constrain the upstream compose definition, which requests all GPUs, to the Slurm-allocated GPU before setting runnable=true.",
